- Секции: bonus details (suma, cod, rulaj), cum activezi step-by-step,
  termeni cheie, avantaje-dezavantaje, comparație cu 2-3 alte, FAQ
- Schema.org: Offer + Product
- Cross-links: обязательный на review этого бренда

